{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>חי חי.</b> [Repeated] twice, and the meaning: one who lives as I do, or who shall live after his illness, is obligated to praise You. And the meaning is by mouth, for in it you see the joining of the soul with the body by way of praises. Some say that the first חי is the Name, but there is no need." "<b>אב לבנים יודיע.</b> These truths:"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:56.594916676Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}